# CRA build residue from an unrelated "Uber Dashboard" app that was left in the
# working tree. The bundle in static/ contains that app, not golive.wiki. These
# files are untracked and must stay that way: a static deploy would otherwise
# publish a dashboard app under this domain. Vite output goes to dist/ (ignored
# above), so nothing here belongs to this project.
/static/
/asset-manifest.json
/manifest.json
/favicon.ico
/logo192.png
/logo512.png
/robots.txt
